/node_modules
/server/node_modules

# A secret never belongs in the checkout. The push server's VAPID key pair and
# its database are written to /var/lib/yourcustombible rather than here,
# because the deploy script runs "git clean -f", which deletes untracked files
# - including anything named here that is not ignored. Listing .env is the
# second line of defence, not the first.
.env